<title>CHINA: China area under grain up 2.0 percent in 1996.</title>
<headline>China area under grain up 2.0 percent in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The area of cultivated land under grain in China has risen by 2.0 percent according to State Statistical Bureau figures available at the end of August, the Financial News said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said the total area under grain had increased by 2.17 million hectares from 1995.</p>
<p>China has forecast a record grain harvest of 480 million tonnes this year, up from 466 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
